# nr-office-pdf-content-ops: what the lead applies (all of it is in files this task does not own)

Not compiled: cargo was not run (the lead compiles the wave). rustfmt parsed every new Rust file; the type check has not
been done. The recording was produced by running Node (applyPdfBatch over pdf-lib documents) once.

## 1. native/core/crates/mixdog-office-pdf/src/lib.rs

After `pub mod adapter;` (the list the earlier tasks added to) add:

    pub mod batch;
    pub mod content_ops;
    pub mod marks;
    mod flatten;

Optional single-import re-exports for the tool layer, after the existing `pub use` lines:

    pub use batch::{PdfFormView, apply_batch};
