## 2. native/core/Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock, mixdog-office-pdf/Cargo.toml, mixdog-workspace-hack

Nothing: the new modules use mixdog-fsio, mixdog-js, mixdog-office-base, mixdog-pdf, mixdog-raster (SvgFonts), mixdog-rt
(CancellationToken), tokio (the current-thread runtime `ocr_pages` blocks on, features the crate already enables),
serde_json; the twin test uses mixdog-testkit and mixdog-office-base (test-support), all already dependencies or
dev-dependencies of the crate. No new crate and no new workspace edge.

